    Description_lang: `Agent Renzik "The Shiv" leads a covert mission to infiltrate a crooked Darkfuse project at the Waterworks dam. The mad scientist behind it all must be neutralized in order to cut off the power headed towards Gallywix's sinister schemes.`,
