      Name_lang: "Blazikon",
      Description_lang: "Living flame hungers for fuel. Blazikon burns eternal in Darkflame Cleft, simmering with malice and rage. Loyal kobold attendants worship here, for his incendiary realm is surrounded by dire darkness. Fanatic kobolds would gladly sate this monstrosity's hunger by sacrificing... you.",
