      Name_lang: "Hex Lord Malacrass",
      Description_lang: "Rumored to be the most feared witch doctor of the Amani tribe in decades, Hex Lord Malacrass has done the unthinkable and sealed the essence of several mighty troll animal gods in their strongest champions... keeping the darkest one for himself.",
