      Description_lang: "Within the Halls of Atonement, past the courtyard and gargoyles, is a church unlike any seen on Azeroth.  This is where the High Adjudicator Aleez presides over a congregation of spirits, spreading the dark word of Sire Denathrius to the undeserving.",
