      Description_lang: "Leymor was born of a humble seedling that Malygos found in a pool of ley energy. Once but a small sprout in Sindragosa's garden, over millenia Leymor has shot up like a weed. Left to its own devices, the looming giant would surely overrun the entirety of the Azure Vault.",
